<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus strait re-opened to sea traffic.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus strait re-opened to sea traffic.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's Bosphorus strait was re-opened to sea traffic at mid-day on Saturday after fog lifted, Turkey's Anatolian news agency said.</p>
<p>The strait has been closed to traffic since early hours on Saturday due to dense fog.</p>
